  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Festa 2015 was held at four venues: Hiroshima on 3 November 2015, Pacifico Yokohama on 7 and 8 November, Intex Osaka on 15 November and Nagoya's Fukiage Hall on 29 November. Every visitor got an original holo Pikachu, and Play Points from the side events bought prizes such as an original Mewtwo for one point, Bronzong and Empoleon BREAK. Its tournaments were the CoroCoro Challenge and the Victory Battle.",
